{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112195","id":2962795356,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wmKtc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112195","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112195.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112195.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112195","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112195/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112195/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112195/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/69c775fd61ffcac253f91b6f6d34e21fa951e79a","number":112195,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[.Net] Implement Opt-in Automatic Null Check for Exported Members","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR aims to enhance the usability of the Nullable Reference Type feature by introducing automatic checks for exported members via a new generated override on the virtual method `ValidateExportedProperties`.\r\n\r\nThis feature is enabled under the following conditions:\r\n1. The line `<GodotEnableExportNullChecks>true</GodotEnableExportNullChecks>` must be included in the `csproj` file.\r\n2. The nullable context should be enabled for an exported type, either by including `<Nullable>enable</Nullable>` in the `csproj` or by using `#nullable enable` in your code.\r\n3. The exported member does not have a nullability annotation (without `?`).\r\n\r\nWith this improvement, users will no longer need to frequently write `* = null!` for every not-null exported variable or perform null checks at every instance call. The binding will automatically check these values once the scene is created.\r\n\r\nTo be specific, the following node type:\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n\r\nusing Godot;\r\n\r\npublic partial class Main : Node\r\n{\r\n#nullable disable\r\n    [Export] private string _stringValue;\r\n    [Export] private StringName _stringNameValue;\r\n    [Export] private NodePath _nodePathValue;\r\n    [Export] private Node _nodeValue;\r\n    [Export] private Resource _resourceValue;\r\n    [Export] private Dictionary<int, Node> _dictionaryValue;\r\n    [Export] private Array<string> _arrayValue;\r\n    [Export] private int[] _intValue;\r\n    [Export] private string[] _stringArrayValue;\r\n#nullable enable\r\n    [Export] private string _stringValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private StringName _stringNameValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private NodePath _nodePathValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private Node _nodeValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private Resource _resourceValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private Dictionary<int, Node> _dictionaryValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private Array<string> _arrayValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private int[] _intValueNotNull;\r\n    [Export] private string[] _stringArrayValueNotNull;\r\n    \r\n    [Export] private string? _stringValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private StringName? _stringNameValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private NodePath? _nodePathValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private Node? _nodeValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private Resource? _resourceValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private Dictionary<int, Node>? _dictionaryValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private Array<string>? _arrayValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private int[]? _intValueMayBeNull;\r\n    [Export] private string[]? _stringArrayValueMayBeNull;\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nWould result in the following check code:\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n\r\nusing Godot;\r\nusing Godot.NativeInterop;\r\n\r\npartial class Main\r\n{\r\n#pragma warning disable CS0109 // Disable warning about redundant 'new' keyword\r\n    /// <summary>\r\n    /// Cached StringNames for the methods contained in this class, for fast lookup.\r\n    /// </summary>\r\n    public new class MethodName : global::Godot.Node.MethodName {\r\n    }\r\n#pragma warning restore CS0109\r\n    /// <inheritdoc/>\r\n    [global::System.ComponentModel.EditorBrowsable(global::System.ComponentModel.EditorBrowsableState.Never)]\r\n    protected override void ValidateExportedProperties()\r\n    {\r\n        this._stringValueNotNull ??= string.Empty;\r\n        this._stringNameValueNotNull ??= new global::Godot.StringName();\r\n        global::System.ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(this._nodePathValueNotNull, \"_nodePathValueNotNull\");\r\n        global::System.ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(this._nodeValueNotNull, \"_nodeValueNotNull\");\r\n        global::System.ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(this._resourceValueNotNull, \"_resourceValueNotNull\");\r\n        global::System.ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(this._dictionaryValueNotNull, \"_dictionaryValueNotNull\");\r\n        global::System.ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(this._arrayValueNotNull, \"_arrayValueNotNull\");\r\n        this._intValueNotNull ??= global::System.Array.Empty<int>();\r\n        this._stringArrayValueNotNull ??= global::System.Array.Empty<string>();\r\n        base.ValidateExportedProperties();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd the following resource type:\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n\r\nusing Godot;\r\n\r\n[GlobalClass]\r\npublic partial class MyResource : Resource\r\n{\r\n    [Export] private Resource _resource1;\r\n#nullable enable\r\n    [Export] private Resource _resource2EnableNullChk;\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nWould result in the following check code:\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n\r\nusing Godot;\r\nusing Godot.NativeInterop;\r\n\r\npartial class MyResource\r\n{\r\n#pragma warning disable CS0109 // Disable warning about redundant 'new' keyword\r\n    /// <summary>\r\n    /// Cached StringNames for the methods contained in this class, for fast lookup.\r\n    /// </summary>\r\n    public new class MethodName : global::Godot.Resource.MethodName {\r\n    }\r\n#pragma warning restore CS0109\r\n    /// <inheritdoc/>\r\n    [global::System.ComponentModel.EditorBrowsable(global::System.ComponentModel.EditorBrowsableState.Never)]\r\n    protected override void ValidateExportedProperties()\r\n    {\r\n        if (this._resource2EnableNullChk == null) throw new global::System.NullReferenceException(\"The exported property/field '_resource2EnableNullChk' of type 'Godot.Resource' is null.\");\r\n        base.ValidateExportedProperties();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones